{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Les histoires de Coraline", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Deux chambres et deux salles de bains : Quel appartement choisir ? ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant d\u00e9crit en fran\u00e7ais \u00e9crit et oral des pi\u00e8ces, des maisons et des objets des immeubles dans des situations sociales quotidiennes ou de travail. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Ce que l'on trouve dans une salle de bain", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Dans une salle de bain, on trouve souvent : </br><ul><li> un lavabo <li> une baignoire<li>  un robinet <li>  une pomme de douche <li>  des toilettes<li> un bidet<li>  des placards de rangement<li>  des meubles de toilette<li>  un tapis de bain<li> des serviettes de toilette.</li></ul>", "type": "describer"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la salle \u00e0 manger", "type": "name"}, {"content": "la pi\u00e8ce o\u00f9 l'on prend les repas ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils ont chacun une grande salle \u00e0 manger.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on utilise pour parler d'un appartement.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "meubl\u00e9, meubl\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "dot\u00e9 d'un mobilier comme une table, des chaises, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple :  Aucune pi\u00e8ce n'est meubl\u00e9e.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "expos\u00e9, expos\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "soumis \u00e0 quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'immeuble est moins expos\u00e9 aux fum\u00e9es des pots d'\u00e9chappement. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la salle de bain en-suite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une salle de bain qui est accessible sp\u00e9cialement pour la pi\u00e8ce principale", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'HLM offre une salle de bains en-suite.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le quartier r\u00e9sidentiel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "d\u00e9crit une zone o\u00f9 se concentrent des habitations ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'appartement se trouve dans le quartier r\u00e9sidentiel.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le pot d'\u00e9chappement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le tuyau d'\u00e9vacuation de la fum\u00e9e dans une voiture", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La fum\u00e9e des pots d'\u00e9chappement peut s'av\u00e9rer tr\u00e8s toxique.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la salle de bain compl\u00e8te", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une pi\u00e8ce qui contient des toilettes, un lavabo et une douche ou une baignoire", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel comprend une salle de bain compl\u00e8te.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la nuit porte conseil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "le repos aide \u00e0 prendre des d\u00e9cisions importantes ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je ne vais pas me d\u00e9cider maintenant. La nuit porte conseil !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la pi\u00e8ce principale", "type": "name"}, {"content": "l'habitation la plus grande de la maison, qui comporte une salle de bain priv\u00e9e", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils ont chacun autant de pi\u00e8ces principales.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Cherchez sur Internet deux petites annonces d'appartements dans deux villes diff\u00e9rentes</br>au monde ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Comparez ces deux petites annonces dans </br>la grille ci-dessous (remplissez  la grille avec l'information demand\u00e9e). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Appartement A&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Appartement B&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superficie :\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Co\u00fbt du loyer :\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nombre de pi\u00e8ces :\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je compare des appartements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je&nbsp;parle&nbsp;d'objets et&nbsp;de&nbsp;pi\u00e8ces.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "L'expression de la comparaison", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour comparer deux objets, personnes ou situations, on utilise des comparatifs de sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9, d'inf\u00e9riorit\u00e9 ou d'\u00e9galit\u00e9. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparatif de sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plus + adjectif/adverbe&nbsp;+&nbsp;que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">L'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel est plus grand que l'appartement HLM.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verbe + plus + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'aime l'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel plus que l'appartement HLM.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"plus de/d' + nom + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il y a plus d'avantages que d'inconv\u00e9nients.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "L'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel est mieux que l'appartement HLM. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Cette tarte est meilleure que ce g\u00e2teau. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "&nbsp;", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparatif d'inf\u00e9riorit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"moins + adjectif/adverbe&nbsp;+ que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">L'appartement HLM est moins cher que l'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verbe + moins + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'aime l'appartement HLM moins que l'appartement r\u00e9sidentiel.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"moins de/d' + nom + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Il y a moins de bruit dans cet appartement.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparatif d'\u00e9galit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Exemple\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"aussi + adjectif/adverbe&nbsp;+ que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'ai trouv\u00e9 deux petites annonces aussi int\u00e9ressantes l'une que l'autre.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verbe + autant + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'aime cet appartement autant que toi.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"autant de/d' + nom + que\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">J'ai visit\u00e9 autant d'appartements que toi.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Remarque : <span class=\"strong\">que</span> est g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement suivi d'un nom, d'un pronom disjoint ou d'un pronom d\u00e9monstratif. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Aussi, il existe des comparatifs de sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9 irr\u00e9guliers.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectif/Adverbe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparatif\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"meilleur, meilleure, meilleurs, meilleures \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bien\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mieux\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mauvais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pire, pires\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Remarque : <span class=\"strong\">Meilleur</span> et <span class=\"strong\">pire</span> sont des adjectifs, ils s'accordent avec le premier \u00e9l\u00e9ment de comparaison.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lorsque l'on forme le comparatif de sup\u00e9riorit\u00e9 ou d'inf\u00e9riorit\u00e9 avec un adjectif ou un adverbe, il est possible d'employer un deuxi\u00e8me adverbe : <br/> Exemple : <br/><span class=\"italic\">Cet appartement est beaucoup plus cher que l'autre.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lorsque plusieurs adjectifs ou adverbes sont employ\u00e9s, il est n\u00e9cessaire de r\u00e9p\u00e9ter le comparatif : <br/> Exemple : <br/><span class=\"italic\">Cet appartement est plus grand et plus joli. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Note professionnelle ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Au travail, lorsque vous souhaitez obtenir plus d'informations, on pose des questions ouvertes. Les questions ouvertes facilitent les \u00e9changes et le dialogue. Pour former une question ouverte, on peut soit utiliser un adverbe (<span class=\"strong\">pourquoi</span>, <span class=\"strong\">comment</span>, etc.) soit un adjectif ou pronom interrogatif (<span class=\"strong\">quel</span>, <span class=\"strong\">quoi</span>, etc.).", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Comment rangez-vous les dossiers ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "\u00c0 quelle heure est la r\u00e9union ? ", "type": "example"}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler des pi\u00e8ces dans une maison.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux comparer des objets, des prix et des endroits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de ce que j'ai \u00e0 faire.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Dans quel type de logement habitez-vous ? Combien de pi\u00e8ces il y a ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Y a-t-il des diff\u00e9rences ou similitudes remarquables entre elles&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Comparons les appartements ! Lequel allons-nous choisir ?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data"